  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_6f93d57989544af49c8650048226eefb",
      "statement": "The monorepo contains five packages: kit (core), kit-ng (Angular adapter), kit-react (React adapter with /next subpath), kit-vue (Vue adapter with /nuxt subpath), and cli (ulabase/ula infrastructure-as-code tooling). All share the same version and are released together.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/cli/package.json",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:8ec2a68ebaccf301d938e3f0e6de072356304d16851f4f597f7f7a13b5399b2e"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/kit/src/index.ts",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:b39b338894832a31d917234a39afb2b950198b72952b55a3cd0efeb3495427e0"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_ae678a31e16d483f9c22394edd045724",
      "statement": "The monorepo follows a strict layered architecture: Layer 1 is @ulabase/kit (core, zero dependencies, framework-agnostic), Layer 2 is the framework adapters (kit-ng, kit-react, kit-vue) that depend on kit and add reactive wrappers, and Layer 3 is @ulabase/cli which depends on kit for apiFetch and token utilities but is not an adapter.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/cli/package.json",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:8ec2a68ebaccf301d938e3f0e6de072356304d16851f4f597f7f7a13b5399b2e"
        },
        {
