    {
      "id": "claim_fee75b3ceffd432aacf504dccb435ce7",
      "statement": "Adapter payments tests are covered by section E of docs/ADAPTER_CONTRACT.md (E1–E10). Key rules: nothing touches /stripe/* unless config.payments is true; the subscription reloads on switchTeam but not on updateProfile/acceptConsents (key on team id, not user identity); canManageBilling compares the user's team role against config.ownershipRole (default 'owner').",
