      "id": "claim_4fb378c7ad39421f97559efa5f4fb0ef",
      "statement": "Payments and cart are separate reactive surfaces from auth in every SPA adapter. Payments: RhPaymentsService (Angular), usePayments() under RhPaymentsProvider (React), usePayments() under createRhPayments(config, rhAuth) (Vue). Cart: RhCartService (Angular), useCart() under RhCartProvider (React), useCart() under createRhCart() (Vue). Each reads the user from the auth surface only to derive canManageBilling.",
