    {
      "id": "claim_f1281449f3b0433da0daa02b9310e762",
      "statement": "The ServiceClient caches its minted token and shares in-flight mint requests so that concurrent steps in a setup do not burst identical /jwt calls when the token turns over. Tokens are renewed one minute before expiry (RENEW_MARGIN_MS = 60_000).",
